    <guid isPermaLink="false">654fb34c0c723621c7f50796</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Nov 2023 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hey!hey!hey!</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是你们的主播，咕噜！在这里我们一起探索「敢爱、敢闯、敢表达、敢冒险」的女性人生。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>今天介绍两个很会挣钱的女人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>迪安 @迪安不是dian</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欣然@黑藏狐DxR</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>迪安早年有2次创业经历，重回职场，在上一家公司，帮品牌从0到5000万.做过三个品类第一，刚裸辞2个月继续创.</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>和迪安的豪华工作背景不同，欣然大二才想明白自己想学什么。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>因为发在b站上毕业设计拿到投资，经验不足负债关停后，油开始了自己的设计工作室。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这期内容给每个有野心，有冲劲的女孩，搞钱不只是为自己创造物质生活，钱就是社会资源，让我们大女人们，手握更多资源吧！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>++时间线++</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;迪安：创业两次、重回职场、再次创业…图点啥？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> 从0到1的底气，是哪里来的？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a></span></strong><span> 从“差生”到自由职业，欣然都经历了什么</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> 普通家庭的孩子，创业失败脑子里在想什么</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a> 创业需要多少钱？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 创业和打工，金钱观截然不同</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 靠自媒体赚钱，越来越难</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">18:19</a> 如果我是男孩，父母是不是会对我有更高的期待</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 自由职业靠自媒体拓展业务靠谱吗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 更好的账号定位，是2个重叠标签</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a> 5年老博主的自媒体涨粉付费内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">27:41</a> 接广，又爽又烦</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> 最难的，是管理自己的精力和时间</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a> 只有外向、爱社交的人能创业吗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2021">33:41</a> 想尝试自由职业，如何跟老板谈判</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> </span></strong><span>自然规则会在混乱中，给你更多安全感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2293">38:13</a> 小彩蛋：欣然创业失败的日子怎么过的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>++找到咕噜++</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信/红书/B站：咕噜健身厨房</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：咕噜健身吃喝日记</span></p><span></span><p><span>++提到的书++</span></p><span></span><p><span>瑞·达利欧，原则</span></p><span></span><p><span>费里斯，每周工作4小时</span></p><span></span><p><span>++找嘉宾歪++</span></p><span></span><p><span>迪安红书： @迪安不是dian</span></p><span></span><p><span>欣然红书：@黑藏狐DxR</span></p><span></span><p><span>++BGM++</span></p><span></span><h1><span>Hailee Steinfeld - Love Myself</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>taylor swift- the man</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>sara_bareilles - brave</span></h1><span></span><p><span>Mae Muller - Me Myself I</span></p>]]></description>
