    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我是咕噜！在这里我们一起探索「敢爱、敢闯、敢表达、敢冒险」的女性人生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有剧透！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>有剧透！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>咕噜，忠实芭比爱好者，去年有电影消息放出后就开始期待；</span></p><span></span><p><span>大发，对电影和芭比都没啥兴趣，为了小妇人的导演走进电影演，出来两眼放光。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们两个在看完电影的激动心情下，录了这期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于芭比的前世今生、她的争议性、以及我们为什么如此推荐你们去看这部粉红色的“无脑”商业片。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你会拥有一段快乐的收听旅程！</span></p><span></span><p><span>有剧透！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>++时间线++</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 我们对于电影的第一印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 多少人是为了导演去看芭比啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 芭比真的很超前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a> 芭比世界，另一个父权社会？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> “你不可以胖，但也不能太瘦，但也不能说自己想要变瘦，要说是为了健康”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 酷女孩 vs 傻白甜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1001">16:41</a> 芭比选择真实世界，明智吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> 没有激进，是否有平权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 我们从芭比里，竟然看到了母女关系的美好模版</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 评分两级分化，看不懂，还是不爱看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1854">30:54</a> 谁不想要芭比的衣橱！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>++找到我++</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信/红书/B站：咕噜健身厨房</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：咕噜健身吃喝日记</span></p><span></span><p><span>++BGM++</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hailee Steinfeld - Love Myself</span></p><span></span><p><span>Barbie world —Nicki minaj</span></p><span></span><p><span>Journey to the real world— tame impala</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hey blondie— Dominic fike</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pink—lizzo</span></p><span></span><p><span>What was I made for—— billie eolith</span></p>]]></description>
